## Firebase Storage (required for image/file uploads - MediasService)
## Uses Firebase Admin SDK (service account). Enable Storage: Firebase Console > Build > Storage > Get started.
## Option A: Path to service account JSON file, relative to project root (e.g. accounts.json).
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=accounts.json
## Option B: Or paste the full JSON content of the service account key as a single line (e.g. for Docker/CI).
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account",...}
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=

# PAYPAL
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
PAYPAL_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox # sandbox or live